### 📦 Create Shop
### POST {{url_dev}}/shop/sign-up?lang=vi # can use this but i like header "Accept-Language: vi" instead
POST {{url_dev}}/shop/sign-up
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{api_key}}
Accept-Language: vi

{
  "name": "My Shop7",
  "email": "shop7@example.com",
  "password": "supersecure123",
  "phone": "0123456789",
  "address": "123 Main Street"
}

### 🔑 Login Shop
POST {{url_dev}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{api_key}}
Accept-Language: vi

{
  "email": "shop7@example.com",
  "password": "supersecure123"
}

### 📋 Get Draft Products (shop)
GET {{url_dev}}/product/drafts/all?limit=10&skip=0
x-api-key: {{api_key}}
authorization: {{access_token}}
x-client-id: {{client_id}}

### 🔄 Refresh Token
POST {{url_dev}}/shop/handlerRefreshToken
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{api_key}}
x-client-id: {{client_id}}
x-rtoken-id:{{rtoken_id}}




### Create Furniture Product
POST {{url_dev}}/product
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{api_key}}
x-client-id: {{client_id}}
authorization: {{access_token}}

{
  "product_name": "Furniture 01",
  "product_thumb": "https://example.com/nike-tshirt.jpg",
  "product_description": "Comfortable cotton T-shirt Furniture",
  "product_price": 25,
  "product_quantity": 100,
  "product_type": "Furniture",
  "product_attributes": {
    "brand": "Nike Furniture",
    "size": "L Furniture",
    "material": "Cotton Furniture"
  }
}

### Create Electronic Product
POST {{url_dev}}/product
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{api_key}}
x-client-id: {{client_id}}
authorization: {{access_token}}

{
  "product_name": "iPhone 15",
  "product_thumb": "https://example.com/iphone15.jpg",
  "product_description": "Latest Apple iPhone",
  "product_price": 999,
  "product_quantity": 50,
  "product_type": "Electronics",
  "product_attributes": {
    "manufacturer": "Apple",
    "model": "iPhone 15 Pro",
    "color": "Space Black"
  }
}

